{"id":"Wdb1eca119e63f7678fd99fe5","zh":"数论法","en":"","name":"数论法","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学","concept_id":"C2310db4d64324f9433ea","families":[{"id":"stochastic.methods","label":"随机分析与概率方法"}],"definition_zh":"文中用数论构造代表性选点集的方法。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于在多维随机输入空间构造均匀散布的代表点，组织随机参数、轨道不平顺及联合激励的样本组合，以较少样本开展随机动力计算，也用于选择代表性不平顺谱样本。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wdb1eca119e63f7678fd99fe5","text":"数论法","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S5bffb4fdb27190c0c600","source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"该模型将车辆-轨道耦合系统分为车辆子系统、轨道子系统及轮轨界面系统,可考虑车辆系统、线路系统参数的随机性及轨道随机不平顺的时变性,同时采用数论法实现不同动力参数的组合,用概率密度演化方程解决系统激励输入与响应输出的概率密度传递问题。","citations":[{"source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S6059afcd99270199adc4","source_id":"P113","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"根据概率理论,随机变量的累计分布函数服从均匀分布,可以采用数论法 [16]构造积分域内单位超立方体均匀散布点集,实现随机变量值的优选,令 xk,j=hjk n-int(hjk n) (6) 式中:k=1,2,.","citations":[{"source_id":"P113","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"S48fbba3df845735e75c5","source_id":"P118","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文依据车轮踏面磨耗速率、高斯分布假设及轨道不平顺概率模型,进行车轮踏面磨耗和轨道不平顺的随机模拟;采用数论法(Numerical Theory Method, NTM)实现车轮踏面磨耗和轨道随机不平顺代表性样本的高效选取;最后,给出了车轮踏面磨耗-轨道随机不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机动力分析、可靠度计算方法及典型计算结果。","citations":[{"source_id":"P118","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S6898b2e16461f766a481","source_id":"P118","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"本文假定车轮踏面磨耗和轨道不平顺均具有一定的概率分布特性,用数论法选取代表性的车轮踏面磨耗和轨道随机不平顺联合样本,用概率密度方法分析系统激励样本与随机响应输出间的概率传递问题,从而较为有效的建立了车轮踏面磨耗-轨道随机不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机动力分析模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P118","page":6,"page_end":6}]}],"sources":{"P003":{"id":"P003","title":"A probabilistic model for track random irregularities in vehicle/track coupled dynamics","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai, J Gao","year":"2017","doi":"10.1016/j.apm.2017.06.027","journal_citation":"Applied Mathematical Modelling 51, 145-158","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"xu-2017-track-irregularity"},"P005":{"id":"P005","title":"Extended applications of track irregularity probabilistic model and vehicle–slab track coupled model on dynamics of railway systems","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai, J Gao","year":"2017","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2017.1319961","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 55 (11), 1686-1706","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-extended-probabilistic-track-applications"},"P008":{"id":"P008","title":"Stochastic analysis model for vehicle-track coupled systems subject to earthquakes and track random irregularities","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2017","doi":"10.1016/j.jsv.2017.06.030","journal_citation":"Journal of Sound and Vibration 407, 209-225","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-earthquake-track-stochastic-analysis"},"P057":{"id":"P057","title":"Random simulation method of track irregularities and its application in vehicle-track dynamic analysis","authors":"L Song, H Liu, L Xu, Z Yu","year":"2023","doi":"10.1080/23248378.2022.2069170","journal_citation":"International Journal of Rail Transportation 11 (2), 169-187","label":"Song等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-random-simulation-method-of-track-irregularities-and-its-application-in-vehicle-track-dynamic-analys"},"P113":{"id":"P113","title":"车辆-轨道系统时-空随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.01.012","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-stochastic-model-used-for-temporal-spatial-analysis-of-vehicle-track-coupled-systems"},"P118":{"id":"P118","title":"车轮踏面磨耗及轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2020","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2020.02.011","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2020）","overview_slug":"2020-stochastic-analysis-model-for-vehicle-track-coupled-systems-under-joint-random-irregularities-of-whe"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[{"id":"W169ad5ddb87c35c8a32d","title":"The number theoretical method in response analysis of nonlinear stochastic structures","url":"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s00466-006-0054-9"}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"在六维随机输入空间中选取代表性联合样本。","language":"zh","source_id":"P008","paper_slug":"2017-earthquake-track-stochastic-analysis","title":"地震与轨道随机不平顺作用下车辆—轨道耦合系统随机分析模型","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"原文用于随机变量空间代表性取点的方法，减少所需样本组合。","language":"zh","source_id":"P005","paper_slug":"2017-extended-probabilistic-track-applications","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型与车辆—板式轨道耦合模型在铁路系统动力学中的拓展应用","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"在单位超立方体内选取均匀散布点，以组织随机输入组合。","language":"zh","source_id":"P113","paper_slug":"2018-stochastic-model-used-for-temporal-spatial-analysis-of-vehicle-track-coupled-systems","title":"车辆－轨道系统时－空随机分析模型","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"在随机变量空间构造均匀散布点集，选取联合激励代表样本。","language":"zh","source_id":"P118","paper_slug":"2020-stochastic-analysis-model-for-vehicle-track-coupled-systems-under-joint-random-irregularities-of-whe","title":"车轮踏面磨耗及轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"文中用于高维随机变量代表性取点的方法，以较少点集开展随机动力计算。","language":"zh","source_id":"P003","paper_slug":"xu-2017-track-irregularity","title":"车辆—轨道耦合动力学中的轨道随机不平顺概率模型","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W50e8b5140b2fd361499b16e7","name":"NTM","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"W66e3b900fc0c753d3994ac76","name":"Number theoretical method (NTM)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"W9a2d66b7461d7b6014823bd4","name":"数论方法","language":"zh","kind":"variant","label":"同义表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wadaa8ce13b8198c7650f7faf","name":"numerical theory method","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"Wd7766aeacfa710d8bd625653","name":"Number Theory Method (NTM)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"We003525c20a99bb059a579b5","name":"numerical theory method（NTM）","language":"en","kind":"translation",